  //   Bartolo: "I didn't account for a <italic>liar</> like you being here."
  //   +:none()
  //   +:la(Ada, Anjana)
  //   +:question(Ada)
  //   Ada: "What is that supposed to mean?"
  //   +:la(Anjana, Ada)
  //   +:bored(Anjana)
  //   Anjana: "He wishes I was a liar."
  //   Anjana: "I caught him copying my homework one time; told the teacher about it, and he's denied it ever since."
  //   Anjana: "Typical of a cheat like him. I hate <italic>cheats</>."
  //   +:ld(Anjana, leftup)
  //   +:ld(Ada, leftup)
  //   +:angry(Bartolo)
  //   +:shakeZ(Bartolo)
  //   Bartolo: "<italic cascade-letters=45 color=LIGHTGREY>If you call me that one more time..."
  //   +:ld(Bartolo, rightdown)
  //   Bartolo: "Ahem..."
