  //   +:smirk(Bartolo)
  //   Bartolo: "No matter!  You'll get your comeuppance soon enough."
  //   // +walkToOffset(Bartolo, 16, -16)
  //   +:ld(Bartolo, leftup)
  //   // +:ld(Anjana, rightdown)
  //   +:serious(Anjana)
  // }
  +:worried(Ada)
  Ada: "Let me guess. You are behind our current circumstance?"
  +:la(Bartolo, Ada)
  Bartolo: "Of course I am."
  Bartolo: "<color=LIGHTRED>Carl-Arnold</> can't have you meddling in his affairs right now."
  +:serious(Ada)
  Ada: "He kidnapped <color=YELLOW>Conscience</>. I would say <italic>his affairs</> are now <italic>my affairs</>."
  Bartolo: "He just needs your little <color=LIGHTGREEN>Alternate</> for a while."
  +:question(Ada)
  Ada: "For what?"
  Bartolo: "That's his business.  And I'm just doing him a favor."
  +:jump(Ada)
  +:angry(Ada)
  Ada: "Let us out of here! I need to get <color=YELLOW>Conscience</> back."
  +:smirk(Bartolo)
  Bartolo: "Can't do that. <cascade-letters=50>Lo siento."
  +:la(Bartolo, Ada)
  Bartolo: "At least not until I've gotten a chance to... show you my worth."
  // Bartolo: "This arcade is too easy for students from <color=PURPLE>Erran Valley</> like ourselves."
  // Bartolo: "I've made a few <italic shake />modifications</> to this Instance.  It's customized for people like us!"
  // +:ld(Bartolo, down)
  // +:shakeZ(Bartolo)
  // Bartolo: "This is my <color=LIGHTRED>Fortress</>!  The <color=LIGHTBLUE>infamous impenetrable knot</> right in the middle of the <color=LIGHTPURPLE>Regem Ludos Revirtualis</>!"
